{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1000_008tak", "source_sha256": "264e60eefd7d2cd3df3e9f24559bb63e5ff171bb1a5267bf7d97b5aa76db3af9", "ja": "「私ひとりでは、あの難局を逃げ切ることはできません\nでした。不本意ではありますが、あなたのおかげです」", "zh": "“光凭我一人，是无法逃过那场难关的。\n虽说并非我所愿，但还是多亏了你”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1001_p", "source_sha256": "afc3bd4f2ff8406e634d7a8ace883d34f967524d2830e2e2122ec22bc1d672ea", "ja": "貴音、お疲れ様。\n今喋ってたのって、貴音が演じる怪盗の台詞だよな？", "zh": "贵音，辛苦了。你刚才说的，是你要饰演的怪盗的台词吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "ee0af0222a3a08d557f3edaa29d2aa32b347c27010f7dfd5837b3cb152a9fd71", "ja": "はい。衣装を着てみたところ、つい役の気持ちに……。\nこれも素敵な衣装に魅せられたため。", "zh": "是的。试穿了服装之后，不知不觉便融入了角色的心境……这也是因为被这身华美的服装所倾倒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "dd518e9d0da640d8b825884aa2f1ab1d9b6635955e040f127d33339ba40acbae", "ja": "荘厳さに身が引き締まりますが、心はおおらかに。\n伝説の大怪盗を演じるに相応しい装いかと。", "zh": "庄严之感令人不由得挺直身心，不过内心还需保持宽广。这样的装扮，想来很适合饰演传说中的大怪盗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3ca8589abc4b2e297b4d10d70acbc65df435f7d6af764e458322267d24d4223a", "ja": "それは良かった。\n実際に貴音が着るとエレガントさが増すな。", "zh": "那就好。贵音实际穿上后，优雅感更强了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "907e54c41630ed0157cfbc8ab5489e0adbd441b91389fba321df4cb298d9366a", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとうございます。\n衣装の魅力を引き出せているのであれば、何よりです。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢您。\n如果能将服装的魅力充分展现出来，那就再好不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "a10a0ae7aad4a720b0e31739bce026ec82f97745d23e2ff48454fe36dfa9c972", "ja": "共演する麗花の衣装とは、正反対の趣ですが、\nそれぞれの個性がうまく表現されていますね。", "zh": "与共演的丽花的服装风格截然相反，不过，确实很好地展现出了各自的个性呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8f379a0d6de758101c511346b6efbc5873a788779aff94c21126ceeba3dc0e5d", "ja": "ああ。同じ怪盗でもタイプが全然違うからな。\nそういう違いを、衣装にも反映してもらったんだ。", "zh": "啊。虽然都是怪盗，但类型完全不同嘛。也请他们把这种差异体现到服装上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "ff347e305c92dc787d9b7e9ff0670c989f4a93f69af94416a89dc18861282cda", "ja": "ふむ。魅力の異なるふたりが共闘する物語……。\nなぜだか、劇場の皆の顔が浮かんできます。", "zh": "嗯。两位魅力各不相同的人并肩作战的故事……不知为何，我想起了剧场里大家的脸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1569a1ce4b2c28ac36c5784638cdf4e8e66cf81a1879df2b1dd4e074807f874e", "ja": "劇場のみんなの顔……？", "zh": "剧场大家的脸……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "c6407a9dabcb70f1a93090760ecce00ecb9018bd7a48b246e4498954228b8dfe", "ja": "おそらく、皆との関係性と似ているからでしょう。\n皆とは、高みを目指す好敵手であり仲間でもあります。", "zh": "大概是因为，这和我与大家之间的关系很相似吧。\n大家既是共同向着更高境界努力的对手，也是伙伴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "32c2368ed69f4ee98c5e69f6d1118a247a13681c50bbd6674209c9277f29f9bf", "ja": "これまでも切磋琢磨しあい、\n共に協力し、様々な仕事に挑戦してきましたから。", "zh": "因为我们一直以来都互相切磋琢磨，一起合作，挑战过各种各样的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1012_p", "source_sha256": "61eff077ba6c2e66c86b0ac9f60dd1bc3791c5245a1a85471480ed2c3dbccd72", "ja": "なるほど。確かにそうかもな。仲間がいたからこそ、\n乗り越えられたこともあっただろうし。", "zh": "原来如此。确实有可能是这样。正因为有伙伴在身边，才一定也有过克服困难的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "dc96e5def3261f29e2f9451cb7a2036785601b8ab29758e48ba543e025d87f7b", "ja": "ええ。ひとりでは不可能なことも、\n共に力を合わせれば、不可能も可能に……。", "zh": "是的。一个人无法做到的事，只要齐心协力，就能将不可能化为可能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "290fdf7bc2fe43ffc9eb2d85940a19d2e45b334c506e92d39d22e07ff0edf848", "ja": "伝説の大怪盗という役を通して、改めて仲間の大切さを\n感じました。そして、もちろん……。", "zh": "通过“传说中的大怪盗”这一角色，我再次感受到了伙伴的重要性。而且，当然……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "f1d1b6ebdea70979674cdc6413a55448af55949c40649c89b0be91bd2f6e6f2a", "ja": "{$P$}。\nあなた様の存在の大切さも……。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n我也感受到了您的存在是多么重要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1016_p", "source_sha256": "24284c5cd3ca608a0c8fbd66c3ed8c4a4e338ba17313629da27fc281e123048c", "ja": "ははっ、ありがとう。貴音の存在だって、\n俺やみんなの支えになってるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢。贵音的存在也一直支撑着我和大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "5a23c4b490b0d517d90bcc4990d521c6a58e22397bae49f6e819504702f59599", "ja": "まあ……。事実ならば、真、喜ばしいですね。\nこれからも、劇場の皆とあなた様と……。", "zh": "这样啊……如果是事实，那真是令人高兴呢。\n今后也要和剧场的大家以及您……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0284_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "1007e3e63f6bc457960c67f1743836c8b1df8a4770c7a1946ef099cd24056d7b", "ja": "手を取り合いながら、共に過ごして参りましょう。\nこの幸せな日々がいつまでも続くように。ふふっ。", "zh": "让我们今后也携手并肩，与剧场的大家以及您一同度过吧。\n愿这幸福的时光能够永远延续下去。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
